  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GRZ-UNDP Governance Programme - UNDP governance programme</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">GRZ-UNDP demokratisk samh&#xe4;llsstyrning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet syftar till att f&#xe5; valda departement och statliga          institutioner att leverera policies, ramverk och service med          utg&#xe5;ngspunkt i de m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheterna till 2015. Detta ska uppn&#xe5;s genom bla att arbeta in de ratificerade instrumenten f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga    r&#xe4;ttigheter i det nya utkastet p&#xe5; konstitution, f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrat ledarskap  inom regering &amp; offentlig service, media &amp; civila samh&#xe4;llet, lagstift</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to make targeted Government institutions provide   human rights based policies, frameworks and services by 2015. The     GRZ-UNDP proposes to achieve this through e.g. a new draft            constitution that reflects the ratified international human rights    instruments, improved leadership skills in civil service, media &amp;     CSOs, improved legislation on access to information and media freedom</narrative>
  </description>
